{"asset_key":"ep5/env_story_15360340","episode":"ep5","category":"env_story","story_id":"15360340","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1536034001:1":{"text":"방금 주운 예쁜 돌을 전부 모아 두고 싶어. 하지만 잃어버릴까 걱정도 되네...","source_cn":"我想把我们刚才捡到的漂亮石头都收藏起来，但又怕丢了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41BCE4139BF0A412","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1536034002:0":{"text":"엮어서 손목에 차면 되잖아. 잃어버리지도 않고 예쁠 거야.","source_cn":"你可以把它们都串起来戴在手腕上呀，既不会丢又好看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE59D60BD50E54508","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1536034003:1":{"text":"근데 나 그거 엮을 줄 모르는데...","source_cn":"我也不会串串呀……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9EB17E310D1432F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1536034004:1":{"text":"스톤아트한테 가서 도와달라고 해!","source_cn":"你可以去老石艺那拜托他帮忙呀！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA0D99ECE4B8E44A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1536034005:1":{"text":"스톤아트? 그건 누구야?","source_cn":"老石艺？那是谁？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30F5E86329EF2AF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1536034006:1":{"text":"돌가게를 운영하는 <style=\"highlight\">베르너</style> 오빠 말이야.","source_cn":"就是开石头铺子的<style=highlight>维尔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7E3799524D52B239","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1536034007:1":{"text":"응? 그 형 이름 바꿨어?","source_cn":"咦？他为什么改名字？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC21EF036456E5E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1536034008:1":{"text":"그건 나도 몰라.","source_cn":"那我就不知道了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA92A73F65B17A5AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1536034009:1":{"text":"그런데 오빠네 아빠도 스톤아트라고 불렸으니까, 성씨를 물려받은 거 아닐까?","source_cn":"不过，我听说他爸爸也叫老石艺。应该是继承的姓氏？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC202D4C13AB127DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1536034010:1":{"text":"으, 이상한 성씨네...","source_cn":"唔，好奇怪的姓氏……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0E081C3A32657AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1536034011:1":{"text":"아휴, 그런 건 신경 쓰지 말고 얼른 가서 팔찌로 엮어달라고 하자!","source_cn":"哎呀，别管那么多了，我们先去找他帮忙串手链吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF6B07E9C5AA39EF1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:加斯":{"text":"가스","source":"加斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瑞娜":{"text":"레이나","source":"瑞娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":12,"localized_text_count":11,"speaker_count":2}}